meta {
  name: diff a baseline set of expectations against another
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/mockserver/baseline/compare
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "baseline": [
      {
        "httpRequest": {
          "method": "GET",
          "path": "/api/orders"
        },
        "httpResponse": {
          "statusCode": 200,
          "body": "{\"orders\":[]}"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}

docs {
  Compares a "baseline" array of expectations against a "current" array and returns a structured diff of what was added, removed and changed. When "current" is omitted the baseline is diffed against the instance's live active expectations, which makes this usable as a drift check against a committed baseline.
  
  the baseline expectations, and optionally the set to compare them against
  
  Full API reference: https://www.mock-server.com/mock_server/mockserver_clients.html
}
